fix the glossary split-reveal: drop the stray decorative seam mark, consolidate its shadow onto the one element that owns it (an earlier version double-cast the top edge from both the reveal panel and the block above, worse once widths diverged) and deepen it now that it's the sole source, bleed the reveal to the full width of the article card instead of sitting inset in the prose column, and widen its close button's clearance so it stops overlapping the definition text

