table (magusfile declarations, CLI args, needs literals, the per-target
policy map, charm names), a WHERE-it-does-NOT list (spell op keys after ::,
Buzz map subscripts, project paths), and a worked four-spellings-one-target
example. Fix two contradictions on the same page: "one of the seven canonical
operations" versus the custom-names-allowed paragraph two lines down, and
"applies in depends_on" (depends_on holds project paths, not target names).
Add the FAQ entry.

