style the console app components natively: the tab strip (browser/editor-style square tabs; the active tab reads as the raised panel surface, continuous with its pane), the content outlet + panes, and the home launcher grid - all against --pico-* tokens, on role=tab/tabindex spans so Pico never themes them; startConsole tags the outlet so the layout applies. Verified the tabbed frame renders and opens/switches natively

