-- 6fc42aa15a2a261973bc3775930a0439505270f9 --
add the magus knowledge graph: query surface, freshness, runtime, remote, and global

A deterministic, cache-backed graph of the magus domain that agents and humans query instead of grepping. The read/emit surface: query/explain/path resolve names to nodes and return a budget-bounded neighborhood (a common term no longer pulls in the whole graph); graph deps/export/stats emit and measure it, with export --select rendering a neighborhood as dot/mermaid/graphml. The verbs are mirrored as MCP tools (query/explain/path/stats).

Freshness and scale: the daemon keeps a warm graph invalidated by a file watcher, single-flight and always-fresh (never a stale answer); a run captures fired diagnostics through one sink feeding both the report stream and an isolated @runtime shard of target->diagnostic emits edges; deterministic shards ride the remote cache (content-addressed, @runtime excluded) with an LRU size cap; --global unions registered workspaces with node IDs namespaced by workspace. Extraction adds MGS7001 (unresolvable buzz import) and MGS7002 (dangling doc reference) as silent, queryable node attributes.

